<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>FitnessPro - Suivi fitness complet</title>
  <meta name="description" content="FitnessPro centralise musculation, course GPS, poids, pas, badges et social dans une application mobile claire et motivante.">
  <meta name="google-site-verification" content="deUziBWQNmrnH_hnALtVoQN2L4Mn8dB7TJGeORzvj3Y">
  <link rel="icon" href="/app_icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #08090c;
      --surface: #11151c;
      --surface-soft: #171d28;
      --line: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      --text: #f8fafc;
      --muted: #a6b0c0;
      --soft: #d7deea;
      --orange: #ff6b00;
      --orange-2: #ff9c42;
      --green: #28d17c;
      --cyan: #40c7e8;
      --violet: #b37cff;
      --radius: 8px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }
    a { color: inherit; }
    img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }

    .site-header {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0 0 auto;
      z-index: 50;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
      background: rgba(8,9,12,.74);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }
    .nav {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 32px));
      min-height: 72px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .7rem;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }
    .brand img {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(255,107,0,.3);
    }
    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.3rem;
    }
    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .9rem;
      font-weight: 750;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: #fff; }
    .nav-cta {
      min-height: 40px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      color: #12151b !important;
      background: #fff;
      padding: .62rem .95rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 92svh;
      padding: 116px 0 70px;
      display: grid;
      align-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #08090c;
    }
    .hero-media {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1.1rem;
      padding: 96px max(24px, calc((100vw - 1180px) / 2)) 40px;
      opacity: .58;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hero-media::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(8,9,12,.98) 0%, rgba(8,9,12,.84) 36%, rgba(8,9,12,.42) 100%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8,9,12,.08), rgba(8,9,12,.94));
    }
    .media-stack {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.1rem;
      transform: translateY(-38px);
    }
    .media-stack:nth-child(2) { transform: translateY(16px); }
    .media-stack:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-10px); }
    .media-shot {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
      border-radius: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #05070a;
      box-shadow: 0 28px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.46);
    }
    .media-shot img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 440px;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: top center;
    }

    .hero-inner {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .hero-content {
      max-width: 720px;
    }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .5rem;
      min-height: 34px;
      padding: .35rem .7rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #ffd1ad;
      background: rgba(255,107,0,.12);
      font-size: .76rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .eyebrow::before {
      content: "";
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--green);
    }
    h1 {
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      max-width: 780px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6.6rem);
      line-height: .92;
      letter-spacing: 0;
      font-weight: 950;
    }
    .hero-copy {
      max-width: 630px;
      margin-top: 1.35rem;
      color: #c3cad6;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.18rem);
      line-height: 1.75;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: .8rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    .btn {
      min-height: 50px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: .65rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: .86rem 1.15rem;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 850;
      transition: transform .18s, background .18s, border-color .18s;
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn-primary {
      color: #15181e;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--orange), var(--orange-2));
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(255,107,0,.3);
    }
    .btn-secondary {
      color: #fff;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    }
    .hero-stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: .9rem;
      max-width: 640px;
      margin-top: 2.3rem;
    }
    .stat {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
      padding-top: .9rem;
    }
    .stat strong {
      display: block;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.55rem;
      font-weight: 950;
    }
    .stat span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: .25rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .86rem;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .section {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 94px 0;
    }
    .section-head {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .9fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
      align-items: end;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .label {
      color: var(--orange-2);
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 950;
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: .75rem;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
      line-height: 1.03;
      letter-spacing: 0;
      font-weight: 950;
    }
    .section-lead {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .feature-band {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .feature-main,
    .feature-list {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--surface);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .feature-main {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .92fr 1fr;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 520px;
    }
    .phone-focus {
      align-self: stretch;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: #0c1017;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .phone {
      width: min(78%, 290px);
      border: 10px solid #1b2230;
      border-radius: 32px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #05070a;
      box-shadow: 0 28px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.48);
    }
    .phone img {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 9 / 19.5;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: top center;
    }
    .feature-copy {
      padding: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    }
    .feature-copy h3 {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 2.5vw, 2.35rem);
      line-height: 1.08;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .feature-copy p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.75;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .pills {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: .55rem;
    }
    .pill {
      min-height: 34px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--soft);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      padding: .42rem .72rem;
      font-size: .84rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }
    .feature-list {
      display: grid;
      padding: .75rem;
      gap: .75rem;
    }
    .mini-feature {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 54px 1fr;
      gap: .9rem;
      align-items: start;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1rem;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
    }
    .mini-icon {
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: #12151b;
      background: #fff;
      font-weight: 950;
    }
    .mini-feature h3 {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: .35rem;
    }
    .mini-feature p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .91rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .screens {
      background: var(--surface-soft);
      border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .screen-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: .9rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .screen-tile {
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: #05070a;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.34);
    }
    .screen-tile:nth-child(even) { margin-top: 42px; }
    .screen-tile img {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 9 / 19.5;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: top center;
    }

    .workflow {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .step {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding-top: 1.2rem;
    }
    .step-num {
      color: var(--orange-2);
      font-size: .82rem;
      font-weight: 950;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: .7rem;
    }
    .step h3 {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: .5rem;
    }
    .step p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .download {
      padding: 100px 0;
    }
    .download-panel {
      width: min(1040px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 2rem;
      align-items: center;
      padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,107,0,.22), rgba(64,199,232,.1)),
        #121721;
    }
    .download-panel p {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin-top: .85rem;
      color: #d8deea;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .download-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: .8rem;
    }

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: #07080b;
      padding: 2.4rem 0;
    }
    .footer-inner,
    .copyright {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1.4rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .footer-links a {
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: .88rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: #fff; }
    .copyright {
      margin-top: 1.15rem;
      color: #738095;
      font-size: .82rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .reveal {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(16px);
      transition: opacity .55s ease, transform .55s ease;
    }
    .reveal.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .hero-media {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        opacity: .42;
      }
      .hero-stats,
      .section-head,
      .feature-band,
      .feature-main,
      .download-panel {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .phone-focus { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 2rem 0; }
      .screen-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .workflow { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .download-actions { justify-content: flex-start; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .nav { min-height: 64px; }
      .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta) { display: none; }
      .hero { min-height: auto; padding: 100px 0 52px; }
      .hero-media { display: none; }
      .hero-stats,
      .screen-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .screen-tile:nth-child(even) { margin-top: 0; }
      .section { padding: 68px 0; }
      .btn { width: 100%; }
      .feature-list { padding: 0; border: 0; background: transparent; }
      .mini-feature { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-inner { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <nav class="nav" aria-label="Navigation principale">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <img src="/app_icon.svg" alt="" width="38" height="38">
        <span>FitnessPro</span>
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#features">Fonctionnalites</a>
        <a href="#screens">Ecrans</a>
        <a href="#download" class="nav-cta">Telecharger</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="media-stack">
          <div class="media-shot"><img src="/image/pA.png" alt=""></div>
          <div class="media-shot"><img src="/image/graphpoids.png" alt=""></div>
        </div>
        <div class="media-stack">
          <div class="media-shot"><img src="/image/entrainement en cours.png" alt=""></div>
          <div class="media-shot"><img src="/image/course.png" alt=""></div>
        </div>
        <div class="media-stack">
          <div class="media-shot"><img src="/image/badge.png" alt=""></div>
          <div class="media-shot"><img src="/image/repetpoids.png" alt=""></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-content reveal">
          <div class="eyebrow">Musculation, course et progression</div>
          <h1>L'app qui rend ton entrainement lisible.</h1>
          <p class="hero-copy">FitnessPro rassemble les seances, le cardio, le poids, les pas, les badges et le social dans une interface mobile pensee pour agir vite et suivre tes progres sans te disperser.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/fitnesspro.apk" download>Telecharger l'APK Android</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#screens">Explorer l'app</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-stats" aria-label="Points forts">
            <div class="stat"><strong>50+</strong><span>exercices et programmes pour commencer vite</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>GPS</strong><span>course, distance, duree et historique complet</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>48</strong><span>badges pour garder une vraie dynamique</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="features">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="label">Produit</div>
          <h2>Une app complete, mais pas lourde.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-lead">La page met en avant ce que l'utilisateur vient chercher : demarrer une seance, noter ses performances, courir, visualiser ses progres et rester motive.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-band">
        <article class="feature-main reveal">
          <div class="phone-focus">
            <div class="phone">
              <img src="/image/entrainement en cours.png" alt="Seance en cours dans FitnessPro">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-copy">
            <div class="label">Seance en direct</div>
            <h3>Tout noter pendant l'effort, sans casser le rythme.</h3>
            <p>Ajoute tes exercices, valide tes series, suis les reps, le poids et les temps de repos. L'interface reste concentree sur l'action.</p>
            <div class="pills">
              <span class="pill">Series</span>
              <span class="pill">Reps et poids</span>
              <span class="pill">Timer repos</span>
              <span class="pill">Historique</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <div class="feature-list reveal">
          <article class="mini-feature">
            <div class="mini-icon">01</div>
            <div><h3>Course GPS</h3><p>Une sortie lisible avec distance, allure, duree et suivi dans le temps.</p></div>
          </article>
          <article class="mini-feature">
            <div class="mini-icon">02</div>
            <div><h3>Poids et pas</h3><p>Des indicateurs quotidiens pour comprendre ta tendance, pas juste une valeur isolee.</p></div>
          </article>
          <article class="mini-feature">
            <div class="mini-icon">03</div>
            <div><h3>Badges</h3><p>Des objectifs visibles qui transforment la progression en motivation concrete.</p></div>
          </article>
          <article class="mini-feature">
            <div class="mini-icon">04</div>
            <div><h3>Social</h3><p>Amis, messages et partage de seances pour garder le lien autour des efforts.</p></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="screens" id="screens">
      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-head reveal">
          <div>
            <div class="label">Ecrans</div>
            <h2>Le gros de l'app, en images.</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="section-lead">Une selection d'ecrans principaux pour montrer immediatement le niveau de couverture : accueil, muscu, course, poids, repos et recompenses.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="screen-grid">
          <figure class="screen-tile reveal"><img src="/image/pA.png" alt="Accueil FitnessPro"></figure>
          <figure class="screen-tile reveal"><img src="/image/entrainementA.png" alt="Catalogue entrainement FitnessPro"></figure>
          <figure class="screen-tile reveal"><img src="/image/repetpoids.png" alt="Saisie reps et poids FitnessPro"></figure>
          <figure class="screen-tile reveal"><img src="/image/course.png" alt="Course GPS FitnessPro"></figure>
          <figure class="screen-tile reveal"><img src="/image/graphpoids.png" alt="Suivi du poids FitnessPro"></figure>
          <figure class="screen-tile reveal"><img src="/image/badge.png" alt="Badges FitnessPro"></figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="label">Parcours</div>
          <h2>Simple a comprendre, utile tous les jours.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-lead">Le marketing doit raconter le produit comme il est utilise : choisir, enregistrer, progresser.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="workflow">
        <article class="step reveal">
          <div class="step-num">Etape 01</div>
          <h3>Choisir l'activite</h3>
          <p>Musculation, course, poids ou pas : l'utilisateur arrive vite sur le bon module.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step reveal">
          <div class="step-num">Etape 02</div>
          <h3>Suivre proprement</h3>
          <p>Les donnees importantes sont saisies en contexte, pendant la seance ou juste apres l'effort.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step reveal">
          <div class="step-num">Etape 03</div>
          <h3>Voir la progression</h3>
          <p>Historique, courbes et badges donnent une vision claire de ce qui avance.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="download" id="download">
      <div class="download-panel reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="label">Disponible maintenant</div>
          <h2>Installe FitnessPro sur Android.</h2>
          <p>Telecharge l'APK, teste l'application complete et retrouve toujours les informations legales en bas de page.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="download-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/fitnesspro.apk" download>Telecharger l'APK</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/privacy">Confidentialite</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <img src="/app_icon.svg" alt="" width="38" height="38">
        <span>FitnessPro</span>
      </a>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/privacy">Politique de confidentialite</a>
        <a href="/terms">Conditions d'utilisation</a>
        <a href="/data-deletion">Suppression des donnees</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="copyright">© 2026 FitnessPro. Tous droits reserves. Les pages legales restent accessibles publiquement pour OAuth, support et conformite.</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) entry.target.classList.add('visible');
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.12 });
    document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach((node) => observer.observe(node));
  </script>
</body>
</html>
